# Custom Muse Glimmer configuration for medmcp tool-calling.
#
# Muse Glimmer 30B is Meta's open agentic model (Apache 2.0), built for local
# tool use; it also carries a perception encoder, so it can read images.
#
# num_ctx 131072; keeps ample room for MCP tool schemas (~1500 tokens), the system prompt, and long multi-turn dialogue.
#
# Temperature 0.3 for more deterministic instruction-following and structured output.
# repeat_penalty + repeat_last_n guard against open-ended generation loops.
#
# Needs Ollama >= 0.32.9; older builds reject the manifest with a 412.
#
# Build with:
#   ollama create muse-medmcp -f Modelfile.muse
FROM muse-glimmer:30b
PARAMETER num_ctx 131072
PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 64
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.15
PARAMETER repeat_last_n 256
